# The generated XDP prolog proves that only one packet byte is available, but
# this program attempts to read eight bytes from the packet data pointer.

# Linux: reject
# Alivio: reject
# Prevail: reject
-- asm
ldxdw %r0, [%r1]
exit
-- mem
00
-- verifier
reject
-- verifier reason
(R1 offset is outside of the packet)|(Unsafe packet load)|(Upper bound must be at most packet_size)
